  "marking": "Hex head and socket head screws from M5: steel group + property class + manufacturer mark (e.g. 'A2-70'). Nuts from M5: steel group + class + origin mark. A2/A4 nuts with groove only and no class are treated as class 50. Unmarked product often only meets A2-50-type levels. Reduced load capacity: leading 0 (e.g. 070).",
