  "AS_1111": "ISO metric hexagon commercial bolts and screws - product grade C; property class 4.6 commercial bolts (4.6/S category).",
  "AS_NZS_1252": "High-strength structural bolting assemblies. AS/NZS 1252.1:2016 covers class 8.8 assemblies M12-M36 (bolt, nut, washer supplied as a matched set from one batch), added class 10.9, and recognises EN 14399 HR 8.8 as deemed-to-satisfy. Components carry special identification per Clause 1.5.",
