   "8.8/TB": "8.8, fully tensioned, bearing-type joint (slip allowed until shank bears on hole)",
   "8.8/TF": "8.8, fully tensioned, friction-type joint (no slip at serviceability; faying surface condition matters)",
   "snug_tight_definition": "Tightness from a few impacts of an impact wrench or full effort of a person on a podger spanner"
  }
